# ── ParkX Frontend Environment Configuration ─────────────────────
# Centralized public frontend base URL used for QR pass generation and links.
#
# Default (Production): https://park-x-flame.vercel.app
# If unset, the frontend automatically falls back to the canonical production URL.
#
# Local development:
# To test QR codes locally with mobile devices on your local network, set this to
# your local IP or tunnel URL (e.g., http://192.168.1.100:5173).
# VITE_PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL=https://park-x-flame.vercel.app
